<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Go深浅拷贝 - 标签 - loommii</title><link>https://loommii.github.io/zh-cn/tags/go%E6%B7%B1%E6%B5%85%E6%8B%B7%E8%B4%9D/</link><description>我的个人技术博客</description><generator>Hugo 0.165.0 &amp; FixIt v0.4.5</generator><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Fri, 16 Jan 2026 01:28:43 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://loommii.github.io/zh-cn/tags/go%E6%B7%B1%E6%B5%85%E6%8B%B7%E8%B4%9D/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Go每日一题_188</title><link>https://loommii.github.io/zh-cn/go_practise/go_daily_question_188/</link><pubDate>Mon, 17 Feb 2025 23:43:08 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://loommii.github.io/zh-cn/go_practise/go_daily_question_188/</guid><category domain="https://loommii.github.io/zh-cn/categories/go%E6%AF%8F%E6%97%A5%E4%B8%80%E9%A2%98/">Go每日一题</category><category domain="https://loommii.github.io/zh-cn/categories/go%E8%AF%AD%E8%A8%80%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80/">Go语言基础</category><description>&lt;p&gt;谈一下切片的复制过程。&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;details&gt;&#10; &lt;summary&gt;🔑 答案解析：&lt;/summary&gt;&#10; &lt;h3 class="heading-element" id="go切片分为浅拷贝和深拷贝"&gt;&lt;span&gt;Go切片分为浅拷贝和深拷贝&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="#go%e5%88%87%e7%89%87%e5%88%86%e4%b8%ba%e6%b5%85%e6%8b%b7%e8%b4%9d%e5%92%8c%e6%b7%b1%e6%8b%b7%e8%b4%9d" class="heading-mark"&gt;&#10; &lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&#10; &lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4 class="heading-element" id="浅拷贝"&gt;&lt;span&gt;浅拷贝&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="#%e6%b5%85%e6%8b%b7%e8%b4%9d" class="heading-mark"&gt;&#10; &lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&#10; &lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;Go切片是由长度、容量、底层数值组成的。浅拷贝就是仅复制切片头（切片指针、长度、容量）&lt;br&gt;&#10;由于切片的底层数组是共享的，因此修改切片元素会影响到其他切片。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Go每日一题_101</title><link>https://loommii.github.io/zh-cn/go_practise/go_daily_question_101/</link><pubDate>Fri, 06 Dec 2024 23:42:39 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://loommii.github.io/zh-cn/go_practise/go_daily_question_101/</guid><category domain="https://loommii.github.io/zh-cn/categories/go%E6%AF%8F%E6%97%A5%E4%B8%80%E9%A2%98/">Go每日一题</category><category domain="https://loommii.github.io/zh-cn/categories/go%E8%AF%AD%E8%A8%80%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80/">Go语言基础</category><description>&lt;p&gt;下面这段代码输出什么？&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code&gt;func main() {&#10; var a = [5]int{1, 2, 3, 4, 5}&#10; var r [5]int&#10;&#10; for i, v := range a {&#10; if i == 0 {&#10; a[1] = 12&#10; a[2] = 13&#10; }&#10; r[i] = v&#10; }&#10; fmt.Println(&amp;#34;r = &amp;#34;, r)&#10; fmt.Println(&amp;#34;a = &amp;#34;, a)&#10;}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#10;&lt;details&gt;&#10; &lt;summary&gt;🔑 答案解析：&lt;/summary&gt;&#10; &lt;p&gt;r = [1 2 3 4 5]&#10;a = [1 12 13 4 5]&#10;range 表达式是副本参与循环，就是说例子中参与循环的是 a 的副本，而不是真正的 a。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>